# Sprint Completion Checklist

Every sprint must end with the following checklist.

| Requirement | Status | Notes |
|-------------|--------|-------|
| Matches approved wireframe | ✅ / ❌ | |
| Geometry Specification followed | ✅ / ❌ | |
| Design Language followed | ✅ / ❌ | |
| Existing sections unchanged | ✅ / ❌ | |
| Build successful | ✅ / ❌ | |
| Screenshot generated | ✅ / ❌ | |
| Technical debt documented | ✅ / ❌ | |
| Ready for merge | ✅ / ❌ | |

If any item is marked ❌, explain exactly why.